<p>King Charles III and Queen Camilla began a four-day U.S. state visit that includes meetings with President Trump and first lady Melania Trump, a White House arrival ceremony and a scheduled address by the king to a joint session of Congress on Tuesday. The visit marks the 250th anniversary of U.S. independence and is Charles&#x27; first trip to the United States as monarch, as well as the first visit to the country by a British monarch in two decades. The trip takes place during strained U.S.-UK relations over President Trump&#x27;s war with Iran and his criticism of British Prime Minister Keir Starmer, who has refused to support Washington militarily in the conflict. At the White House ceremony, Trump praised the relationship, while Charles was expected to stress shared democratic traditions and the two countries&#x27; ability to overcome disagreements. Officials reviewed security plans after a shooting at a Washington correspondents&#x27; dinner, but the visit proceeded as planned. The royal couple&#x27;s itinerary also includes a White House state dinner and stops in Virginia and New York City.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/1t7lNHz79LsbW9WNwuG0LL1z2tbSRWDEF5QwqII18nbpMrDBbcVfc_W_DToLacH5G4KCfIKQ1YdERQcKpukP1AKpn61NPhXROYrZQUwNj3PlEdWbStK8Wp1Oiml0CygU8GgXmXF2x7SV6FeLrLhO_9Rtc7ZUjVXfjZmNdy_CiGH35As9ZHLIwHwNgT5nXeHzdAwHKGlkbrGmPFgkk43exOHBMYbXyAPioY7cR4Bn9V3qXL2oCZg2wvoLtuO9ydjOEgrqt-nMubuETuwPcg' alt='U.S. President Donald Trump and first lady Melania Trump greet Britain&#x27;s King Charles and Queen Camilla during an arrival ceremony on the South Lawn of the White House in Washington, D.C., on April 28, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Speech timing: Charles&#x27; address to the joint meeting was scheduled for 3 p.m. ET before members of the House and Senate.</li><li>Ceremonial honors: Tuesday&#x27;s White House welcome included military honors, a 21-gun salute and an inspection of troops, with Trump also expected to make remarks in the White House garden.</li><li>Other disputes: In addition to Iran, accounts cited Trump&#x27;s frustrations over NATO and bilateral trade issues, while KOAA cited his dismissal of British aircraft carriers as &quot;toys&quot;.</li><li>Ambassador&#x27;s reception: At the British ambassador&#x27;s residence, a choir sang the British and American national anthems while the royals mingled with political figures, diplomats and Washington society figures.</li></ul><blockquote>Americans have had no closer friends than the British. - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Buckingham Palace: The palace said the visit would recognize shared history, the economic, security and cultural relationship, and people-to-people connections between the two countries. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/chicago/news/king-charles-visit-trump-us-uk-relations/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>Politico: The outlet said the Oval Office meeting was scheduled to be closed to the press and noted Trump has sometimes changed rules for media access at the last minute. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/live-updates/2026/04/28/king-charles-washington-visit/what-to-watch-us-00894689'>Politico</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/apr/28/donald-trump-king-charles-melania-camilla-white-house-congress-latest-news-updates'>‘Americans have had no closer friends than the British,’ says Donald Trump at UK royal visit – US politics live</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/uk%27s-king-charles-seeks-to-shore-up-trump-ties'>Britain&#x27;s King Charles meets Trump in bid to salvage ties</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/live-updates-king-charles-and-queen-camilla-visit-washington'>Live Updates: King Charles and Queen Camilla visit Washington</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/28/us-has-no-closer-friends-than-the-british-trump-tells-king-charle